---
title: Directives
---

Directives render your own components from markdown. They come from the
`directives` namespace export of `markdown.js`, set as `components` in
`mdsvex.config.json`.

## Inline

Press :kbd[Ctrl] + :kbd[S] to save, the bracket text is `children`.

## Leaf

::figure[A penguin, *very* svexy](src=https://mdsvex.com/penguin.gif)

The bracket text of a leaf is its `label`, and the args are props.

## Container

:::Callout[Heads up](kind=warn)
The body of a container is `children`, and it can hold any markdown:

- a list
- with _emphasis_
:::

:::Callout[]
Empty brackets pass no label.
:::
